        "finding": "The query owner pauseAndDrain sets the pause flag and waits for the active page to settle."
      },
      {
        "path": "ui/packages/loom-ui/src/features/ExplorerBuilder/constructionOperations/ConstructionReshapeEditor.tsx",
        "line": 1795,
        "finding": "The RelatedExpand query owner is passed through the editor boundary."
      },
